sequenceDiagram
  participant C as Cliente
  participant R as AdvancedRemoteControl
  participant D as Radio (Device)
  C->>R: new AdvancedRemoteControl(radio)
  C->>R: togglePower()
  R->>D: isEnabled()
  D-->>R: false
  R->>D: enable()
  C->>R: volumeUp()
  R->>D: getVolume()
  D-->>R: 30
  R->>D: setVolume(40)
  C->>R: mute()
  R->>D: setVolume(0)
  Note over R,D: A abstração apenas delega, então qualquer Device funciona
